@host = http://localhost:18080
@templateId = 1

### API process
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Container database connectivity
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Verify migrations by creating a record (expect 201)
POST {{host}}/api/inspection-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Docker Learning Inspection"
}

### Replace templateId above with the returned id; expect 200
GET {{host}}/api/inspection-templates/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Existing inspection listing in the container database
GET {{host}}/api/inspections?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{organizationId}}
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document in the local Development container
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
